<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/creator> <https://seeds.local/principal/wu> .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/dateCreated> "2026-09-30T15:49:58Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/dateModified> "2026-09-30T15:56:44Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/description> "Repro (2026-09-30, repo-local pendant): create A; create B --deps A; then 'create C --deps B' OR 'create C; dep add C B' -> rc=5 'B blockedOn: camayoc: blockedOn must point at a WorkItem the graph actually holds'. --dry-run passes. It succeeds only if C ALREADY depends on A (then A is in the validated subgraph). INFERRED: the write validates C plus its direct targets, whose blockedOn edges point at seeds outside that subgraph. Blocks any dependency chain deeper than 2." .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/endTime> "2026-09-30T15:56:44Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
