<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/keywords> "dogfood" .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/name> "a write that adds a blocker X is refused when X has its own blocker (create --deps AND dep add)" .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/result> "fixed in #6 (44bef05): validate_batch drops a target's edges to seeds that are not loaded; regression test a_blocker_that_has_its_own_blocker_can_be_added" .
<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.1> <https://schema.org/version> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
